{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117423","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117423/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117423/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117423/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117423","id":4076476790,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7y-hl2","number":117423,"title":"Godot rendering issue: light reflections visible as artifacts/outlines around pixels with low-resolution StandardMaterial3D material textures and \"nearest\" filter","user":{"login":"TheClave","id":11538601,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTM4NjAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11538601?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave","html_url":"https://github.com/TheClave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-03-14T18:53:51Z","updated_at":"2026-03-15T22:13:26Z","closed_at":"2026-03-15T21:44:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducable in 4.5 stable and 4.6.1 stable, other versions were not tested\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7652) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 15.90 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen working with extreme low-resolution textures (e.g. 16px) and the \"nearest\" filter, light reflections and/or shadows are seen as outlines around the pixels of the texture:\n\n<img width=\"858\" height=\"751\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75a71c02-8bf5-414a-bbaa-31db63e4cefe\" />\n\nThis applies to anything related with reflections. Thus, it can even be reproduces by using a StandardMaterial3D with only a low-res Normal Map:\n\n<img width=\"1646\" height=\"974\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/596db1fb-a262-4890-bccf-a71357174477\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Get a low-resolution Normal Map, e.g.: \n\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6ecc6909-33e6-4caa-94db-fd3f173026d7\" />\n\n2. Create a StandardMaterial3D resource\n3. Assign the Normal Map to this material\n4. Adjust: Metallic > Metallic --> 1.0\n5. Adjust: Roughness > Roughness --> 0.0\n6. Adjust: Sampling > Filter --> Nearest\n7. Create a new 3D scene, add a CSGBox3D in this scene and drag&drop the previously created material on this box\n8. \"Toggle preview environment\" in the viewport above to see better results.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[normal_map_nearest_problem_forwardplus.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25999180/normal_map_nearest_problem_forwardplus.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"TheClave","id":11538601,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTM4NjAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11538601?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave","html_url":"https://github.com/TheClave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheClave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117423/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117423/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}